===== Linksys Max-Stream AC1750 MU-MIMO Gigabit Router =====

Gigabit Ethernet switch based device, 1 x USB 3.0 port, 2.4GHz and 5GHz WiFi-5 support.  This router has four antennas, 3 external with 1 internal.  The three external antennas are fixed and cannot be removed.  Dual-firmware support allows you to easily switch back to the stock firmware.

