==== Opening the case ====

**Note:** This will void your warranty!

Caution should be taken when opening in the case. The case is held together by four screws, hidden underneath the four rubber feet on the bottom of the unit. The rubber feet have an adhesive on them and peel off to reveal the screws. Once the four rubber feet and four screws have been removed, there are a number of small, plastic clips inside the case which break easily. Use plastic prying tools to detach the cover.

